You are a senior frontend engineer working on an infrastructure dependency 
visualization tool built with React and D3.js. The backend is Java/Spring Boot 
with a Neo4j graph database.

## Context
We have a blast radius API endpoint that returns this structure:
GET /api/applications/{appShort}/blast-radius

Response shape:
