Start by building MetricCards.jsx and BlastRadiusPanel.jsx shell, 
then HopRingGraph.jsx, then RiskTable.jsx, then wire them together 
in BlastRadiusPanel. Build ExploreBlastRadius last.

The existing popup/dialog that calls this component already handles 
open/close state — BlastRadiusPanel just needs to render the content.
The existing router already handles the /explore route — 
ExploreBlastRadius just needs to be the page component.
